0":"2020-10","2020-11":"2020-11","2020-12":"2020-12","2021-01":"2021-01","2021-02":"2021-02","2021-03":"2021-03","2021-04":"2021-04","2021-05":"2021-05","2021-06":"2021-06","2021-07":"2021-07","2021-08":"2021-08","2021-09":"2021-09","2021-10":"2021-10","2021-11":"2021-11","2021-12":"2021-12","2022-01":"2022-01","2022-02":"2022-02","2022-03":"2022-03","2022-04":"2022-04","2022-05":"2022-05","2022-06":"2022-06","2022-07":"2022-07","2022-08":"2022-08","2022-09":"2022-09","2022-10":"2022-10","2022-11":"2022-11","2022-12":"2022-12","2023-01":"2023-01","2023-02":"2023-02","2023-03":"2023-03","2023-04":"2023-04","2023-05":"2023-05","2023-06":"2023-06","2023-07":"2023-07","2023-08":"2023-08","2023-09":"2023-09","2023-10":"2023-10","2023-11":"2023-11","2023-12":"2023-12","2024-01":"2024-01","2024-02":"2024-02","2024-03":"2024-03","2024-04":"2024-04","2024-05":"2024-05","2024-06":"2024-06","2024-07":"2024-07","2024-08":"2024-08","2024-09":"2024-09","2024-10":"2024-10","2024-11":"2024-11","2024-12":"2024-12","2025-01":"2025-01","2025-02":"2025-02","2025-03":"2025-03","2025-04":"2025-04","2025-05":"2025-05","2025-06":"2025-06","2025-07":"2025-07","2025-08":"2025-08","2025-09":"2025-09","2025-10":"2025-10","2025-11":"2025-11","2025-12":"2025-12","2026-01":"2026-01","2026-02":"2026-02","2026-03":"2026-03","2026-04":"2026-04","2026-05":"2026-05","2026-06":"2026-06","2026-07":"2026-07","2026-08":"2026-08","2026-09":"2026-09","2026-10":"2026-10"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"EN","description":"<p>The Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices (HICP) measures price changes of various consumer goods and services over time (inflation). This dataset is compiled according to the European Classification&nbsp;of Individual Consumption&nbsp;According to Purpose (ECOICOP)&nbsp;ver. 2, available in base years 2025=100 and 2015=100.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>This dataset includes&nbsp;four monthly&nbsp;indicators:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>the index, measuring price changes in relation to a base year&nbsp;</li><li>the annual rate of change,&nbsp;representing the percentage change in a reference month compared to the same month of the previous year (also called annual inflation)&nbsp;</li><li>the monthly rate of change,&nbsp;representing the percentage change in consumer price indices in a reference month compared to the previous month (also called monthly inflation)</li><li>the 12-month average rate of change,&nbsp;comparing the average index over a 12-month period to the average index previous 12-month period.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>All the rates are calculated from the monthly HICP indices.&nbsp;</p>","id":"PRC_HICP_MINR","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"PRC_HICP_MINR","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"26.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2026-01-27T09:31:20+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/PRC_HICP_MINR\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/PRC_HICP_MINR</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2026-01-27</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_HICP_COICOP18_20260128.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_n